---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Cookie Policy | RM CREATIVES" description="Information about cookies used on the RM CREATIVES website.">
  <main class="legal shell">
    <div class="eyebrow">LEGAL / COOKIES</div>
    <h1>Cookie Policy</h1>
    <div class="copy">
      <p>This website may use cookies and similar technologies to provide essential functionality, remember preferences and understand how the website is used.</p>
      <h2>Essential cookies</h2>
      <p>These cookies are required for core website functionality and security.</p>
      <h2>Analytics cookies</h2>
      <p>Where enabled, analytics technologies help us understand traffic and improve website performance. Non-essential tracking should only be activated in accordance with applicable consent requirements.</p>
      <h2>Advertising cookies</h2>
      <p>With your permission, Meta Pixel measures visits to our service pages, the start of an enquiry and successful enquiries, and helps build advertising audiences. Meta may use the _fbp and _fbc cookies. We do not send the contents of enquiry fields to Meta. Your advertising-cookie choice is remembered for up to 180 days. You can change or withdraw it using “Advertising cookies” in the footer.</p>
      <h2>Managing cookies</h2>
      <p>You can control or delete cookies through your browser settings. Blocking certain cookies may affect some website functionality.</p>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about cookies can be sent to <a href="mailto:clientcare@rmcreatives.com">clientcare@rmcreatives.com</a>.</p>
      <p class="note">Last updated: September 2026.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
  .legal{padding:90px 0 140px}.legal h1{font-size:clamp(58px,9vw,130px);letter-spacing:-.07em;line-height:.9;margin:24px 0 90px;font-weight:600}.copy{max-width:780px;margin-left:auto}.copy h2{font-size:26px;letter-spacing:-.035em;margin:48px 0 14px}.copy p{font-size:16px;line-height:1.65;color:#444;margin:0}.copy a{border-bottom:1px solid currentColor}.note{margin-top:60px!important;color:var(--muted)!important;font-size:13px!important}
</style>
